---
source: fixture/src/lib.rs
---
the source
├─ version  the files on disk
├─ has      snapshot
╰─ lacks    history, so page.date is not taken from it

the site
├─ site.format  `ink:format-markdown`  by default
├─ site.root    `docs/`                because docs is there
╰─ site.layout  docs                   because docs is there

docs/guide/install.md
╰─ file.ignore  kept  by default

docs/guide/use.md
╰─ file.ignore  kept  by default

docs/index.md
╰─ file.ignore  kept  by default

docs/guide/install.md
├─ page.publish  published                                       by default
├─ page.kind     a page                                          by default
├─ page.title    “Install”                                       from the heading of docs/guide/install.md, bytes 0..9
├─ page.date     undated                                         by default
├─ page.updated  never updated                                   by default
├─ page.slug     `install`                                       from the name of docs/guide/install.md
├─ page.tags     no tags                                         by default
╰─ page.summary  “Download the binary and put it on your path.”  from the text of docs/guide/install.md

docs/guide/use.md
├─ page.publish  published                                  by default
├─ page.kind     a page                                     by default
├─ page.title    “Use”                                      from the heading of docs/guide/use.md, bytes 0..5
├─ page.date     undated                                    by default
├─ page.updated  never updated                              by default
├─ page.slug     `use`                                      from the name of docs/guide/use.md
├─ page.tags     no tags                                    by default
╰─ page.summary  “Run it in a folder. Back to installing.”  from the text of docs/guide/use.md

docs/index.md
├─ page.publish  published                              by default
├─ page.kind     a page                                 by default
├─ page.title    “Handbook”                             from the heading of docs/index.md, bytes 0..10
├─ page.date     undated                                by default
├─ page.updated  never updated                          by default
├─ page.slug     `index`                                from the name of docs/index.md
├─ page.tags     no tags                                by default
╰─ page.summary  “Start with installing, then use it.”  from the text of docs/index.md

the site
├─ site.home         docs/index.md                          from the name of docs/index.md
├─ site.title        “Handbook”                             from the heading of docs/index.md, bytes 0..10
├─ site.description  “Start with installing, then use it.”  from the text of docs/index.md
├─ site.authors      no one                                 by default
├─ site.language     `en`                                   by default
╰─ site.nav          empty                                  by default
